    "show_in_rest": true,
    "description": "Content sections for concert pages and the front page. Edit them here - ACF saves changes back into ars-nova-core/acf-json on whichever SITE you edit, so if you change fields on staging tell a developer or the next deploy overwrites them. Renderers live in ars-nova-core/includes/project-modules.php: a brand-new layout type needs one written before it will draw anything.",
